    "en": {
      "trackName": "Peer Images Wear - Watch Game",
      "description": "Looking for a fun way to train your memory right from your wrist?\n\nPeer Images Wear is the perfect quick-play puzzle game for your Apple Watch. Tap the question marks to flip the cards, memorize their positions, and find all the matching pairs! Whether you are waiting in line, commuting, or taking a quick break, keep your mind sharp with this classic memory challenge.\n\nFeatures:\n- Multiple Themes: Play with vibrant images of Animals, Travel, Fruits, Flags, Vehicles, Japan, and Spring.\n- Two Difficulty Levels: Choose Normal (4x4 grid, 8 pairs) for a quick session, or Hard (6x6 grid, 18 pairs) for a real mental workout.\n- Time Challenge: A built-in timer tracks your gameplay so you can compete against yourself and beat your own records.\n- Wrist-First Design: Optimized entirely for the Apple Watch. Play offline anytime, anywhere!\n\nMatch the pairs, beat the clock, and exercise your brain today!",
